    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm writing this paper for my intl relations class and i'm kind of stuck. i'm looking at the TPP (the trans-pacific partnership) and trying to figure out if it was actually any good for the domestic working class in the US. like, was it a success for them or just a failure?",
